    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the exhilarating world of &quot;Last Day Lockdown,&quot; where your farewell turns into an unforgettable journey! On your final day at the office, your colleagues have a surprise waiting for you - your workspace transformed into a maze of puzzles and excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode intricate riddles, solve cryptic puzzles, and rediscover the familiar corners of your daily grind as they become the key to your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/6dcdc19010bf3654df01f8d919e44f69.poster.avif?t=1747295490\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/6dcdc19010bf3654df01f8d919e44f69.webm?t=1747295490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/6dcdc19010bf3654df01f8d919e44f69.mp4?t=1747295490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your wits as you decode intricate puzzles and solve cryptic riddles scattered throughout the office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/9feea6d540125e5d795149073845a53c.poster.avif?t=1747295490\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/9feea6d540125e5d795149073845a53c.webm?t=1747295490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646700/extras/9feea6d540125e5d795149073845a53c.mp4?t=1747295490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the nooks and crannies of your familiar workspace, now transformed into the gateway to your escape.</p>",
